            <title>0.2.93</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Mar 2026 20:55:23 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1774324330</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.93</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Agent Permission Prompts in Chat</h2>
<ul>
  <li>When an agent needs permission to run a tool (Bash, Edit, Read, etc.), an inline card now appears in the chat with Allow and Deny buttons — no more silently auto-accepting everything</li>
  <li>Permission cards show the tool name and a description of what it wants to do (e.g., the command to run, or the file to edit)</li>
  <li>Supports freeform question prompts too — when the agent asks a question, you get a text field to type your response</li>
  <li>Unanswered permission requests expire and grey out when the session ends</li>
  <li>Permission history is fully persisted — you can see what was allowed or denied when reopening a conversation</li>
</ul>
<h2>Animated Send/Stop Button</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The send and stop buttons in the chat input bar have been unified into a single animated button — sends when idle, shows a bouncing dot animation while the agent is working, and reveals a stop button on hover</li>
</ul>

<h3>Improvements</h3>
<h2>Chat</h2>
<ul>
  <li>MCP tool calls now show human-readable names instead of raw identifiers (e.g., &quot;Navigate&quot; instead of &quot;mcp__addy__addy_browser_navigate&quot;)</li>
  <li>Tool blocks in expanded tool groups now stretch to full width instead of bunching up on the left</li>
  <li>Send button now enables when you have image attachments queued, even without text</li>
  <li>Activity status label shows &quot;Waiting for your response...&quot; when the agent is blocked on a permission prompt</li>
</ul>
<h2>Conversations Pane</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Pinned conversations now appear in their own section at the top with a pin icon</li>
  <li>Background agent conversations (sub-agents, code reviews, plan reviews) are now hidden from the list to reduce clutter</li>
  <li>Conversation titles are backfilled from pane names so they stay meaningful</li>
</ul>
<h2>Activity Indicators</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Pane activity indicators moved from the header bar to the bottom-center of each pane, keeping headers cleaner</li>
  <li>In chat panes, the animated action button replaces the header indicator — no more duplicate activity signals</li>
</ul>

<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Fixed Cmd+V paste in terminal panes silently failing on macOS 14+ — paste was reading the clipboard on a background thread where it could return nil</li>
  <li>Fixed pinned and snapshot flags being lost when conversations were synced to disk</li>
  <li>Fixed Gemini conversation discovery showing stale sessions with &quot;Just now&quot; timestamps when dates couldn't be parsed</li>
  <li>Fixed thinking blocks not resizing properly after theme changes</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
