        <item>
            <title>0.2.92</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 22 Mar 2026 14:57:09 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1774216452</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.92</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Huge amount of chat UI improvements</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Pick up where you left off seemlessly after closing and reopening Addy</li>
  <li>Better typography</li>
  <li>Copy/paste shows previews in a little dock</li>
  <li>File drop onto chat-mode agent panes now works (previously required terminal mode)</li>
  <li>Better context handling</li>
  <li>Context menu and progress bar with choices for how to handle</li>
  <li>Non-thrashy tool usage indicator</li>
  <li>More compact tool group expansion/collapse</li>
  <li>Tool group text now shows what the agent is doing (&quot;Reading AppDelegate.swift…&quot;, &quot;Searching…&quot;) instead of generic &quot;Running 3 tools…&quot;</li>
  <li>Better submit/cancel button contrast, improved text alignment</li>
  <li>OAuth/CLI login flows (Claude Code etc.) open correctly in Addy&#x27;s browser — BROWSER env var had a space that broke some tools</li>
</ul>
<h2>Codex Streaming Chat Phase 1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Streaming now works, still needs more work to be useful</li>
</ul>

<h2>Conversations Pane</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Find past conversations and pick them back up or fork them with context</li>
  <li>Eesily tell which ones are chat or terminal mode</li>
</ul>
<h2>Theming</h2>
<ul>
  <li>More light mode improvements</li>
</ul>]]></description>
